From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 09:55:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/49] winewayland: Respect xdg toplevel configure bounds

Track xdg_toplevel configure_bounds as part of the configure generation
and apply committed bounds as floating toplevel max-size limits.

Expose committed Wayland bounds through a user driver max-track hook so
Win32 sizing uses the same limit as the compositor.
---
